# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Third-party options the video engine's ESP-IDF backends rely on; merged into
# a product's configuration only when the engine is selected (build
# integration, layer 5). Camera options (sensor driver, ISP pipeline, CSI
# buffers) belong to the camera parts.
#
# This file holds only symbols every target knows when the engine is selected.
# Options of libraries that exist on some targets only live in
# sdkconfig.defaults.<target>, merged for that target alone; a symbol the build
# does not know would fail the read-back check of the merged configuration.
# None so far: see sdkconfig.defaults.esp32p4.
